    {"x": 0.55, "y": 2.17, "w": 10.9, "text": "One string: the program finds the words itself, and *.TXT arrives as written unless the program\nis linked with SETARGV.OBJ (Lab 9.2). The program's name comes after the environment.", "size": 13.5, "style": "italic", "kind": "dos"},
    {"x": 0.55, "y": 4.92, "w": 10.9, "text": "An array of words: the shell has already expanded *.txt into a.txt b.txt ... and removed quotes\nand >o; the program never sees them. Arguments and environment together: at most ARG_MAX.", "size": 13.5, "style": "italic", "kind": "bsd"}
